      ],
      "explanation": "The Apply documentation explicitly requires durable quorum storage before application, and FSM.Apply specifies majority commitment. The completed documentation connects successful replication, commitment notification and application. These expectations support the goal independently of observed code. However, voter-only accounting and configuration replacement require membership-specific interpretation. sendLatestSnapshot also reports match at the snapshot index, so matching history cannot require indefinite retention of raw entries. The snapshot receiver and storage contracts remain unestablished.",
