      "explanation": "The consumer dependency is now concrete: successful nonempty AppendEntries requests reach updateLastAppended, which reports the final entry index to commitment.match. That method documents disk agreement through the reported index. This grounds the acknowledgment responsibility. The truncation followed by failed StoreLogs branch remains visible, but applicability of the selected fault and subsequent continued operation is unresolved.",
